In Department condita sicut Laboratory Mathematica in manu Lenard, John Jones May XIV MCMXXXVII, quamquam is did non adepto recte statutum usque post Belli Orbis Terrarum II. Laboratorium Septentrionalis Nova erat proque domo longis Wing est pristini Advertising School, in Novum Site. In die qua fundata est, cum in animo sit computing ministerium providere ad communem usum, et quod a centro est, in development of Universitatis elit computational. Et Diplomatis Cambridge in Computer Science est mundi primum doceri utique postgraduate in computing, incipiens in MCMLIII.